<section class="homecam-section" id="storage-assessment"><div class="container"><h2 class="section-title">Decide what you need <span>to retain.</span></h2><p>Start with the incident you may need to review: how long could it take to discover it, which views matter, and whether continuous context or event clips are required? A home entrance, shop counter and office loading area may need different schedules. Agree the target with the owner rather than claim one retention period suits everyone.</p><div class="row g-3"><?php foreach([
